# A Smudge on One's Record (windurst 12): Hariga-Origa and Serukoko in Windurst Waters. The guard (Chasing Tales
# completed, fame level 4, no mustZone; each side), the offer 413 (declined, then accepted), Hariga's 414 and Serukoko's 415, the
# trade of exactly a Vial of Slime Oil and a Frost Turnip (417 (5000): completed with the Map of Feiyin, 5000 gil, fame
# +40, exp 2000; the items taken; mustZone set), and the completed 418 / 419 (importantOnce) until the char zones.
# Hariga's and Serukoko's scripts hold only an idle animation; defaults 372 and 373. Glyph Hanger also names both: it is
# set completed, so its completed section answers Hariga (386) until Chasing Tales is completed (the first talk). No
# mission names them.
lists WindurstWaters/Hariga-Origa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Hariga-Origa/onTrade WindurstWaters/Serukoko/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/413 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/417
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-60.5,-5.5,105.2
quest Windurst.GlyphHanger completed
fame Windurst 225
item VialOfSlimeOil x2
item FrostTurnip x2
item BoneChip
login
trade Hariga-Origa VialOfSlimeOil x1 FrostTurnip x1  # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Hariga-Origa                # Chasing Tales not completed: not met; Glyph Hanger's completed 386 (replaceDefault) answers
finish
quest Windurst.ChasingTales completed
fame Windurst 224
trigger Hariga-Origa                # fame 224 (level 3): not met; her default 372
finish
fame Windurst 225
charvar Quest[2][12]mustZone 238    # a GM sets the quest's mustZone
trigger Hariga-Origa                # mustZone set: not met; 372
finish
charvar Quest[2][12]mustZone 0
trigger Hariga-Origa                # guard met: 413 (0, slime oil, frost turnip)
finish option=1                     # declined: nothing
trigger Hariga-Origa                # 413 again
finish option=0                     # begun
trigger Serukoko                    # accepted: 415 (0, slime oil, frost turnip)
finish
trigger Hariga-Origa                # accepted: 414 (0, slime oil, frost turnip)
finish
trade Hariga-Origa BoneChip x1      # not the two items: nil
trade Hariga-Origa VialOfSlimeOil x1  # the oil alone: not exact, nil
trade Hariga-Origa VialOfSlimeOil x1 FrostTurnip x1 BoneChip x1  # the two and more: not exact, nil
trade Hariga-Origa VialOfSlimeOil x1 FrostTurnip x1  # exactly the two: 417 (5000)
finish                              # completed: Map of Feiyin, 5000 gil, fame +40, exp 2000; the two items taken; mustZone 238
trigger Serukoko                    # completed, mustZone: 419 (importantOnce)
finish
trigger Hariga-Origa                # completed, mustZone: 418 (importantOnce: Event priority once, then Default)
finish
trigger Hariga-Origa                # Default priority now, a tie with her default 372: the lookup's cycle plays 372
finish
trigger Hariga-Origa                # the cycle: 418 again
finish
trade Hariga-Origa VialOfSlimeOil x1 FrostTurnip x1  # completed: no trade handler, nothing
rezone                              # the mustZone cleared
trigger Hariga-Origa                # no section: 372
finish
